-- CONVERSION NOTE (pywal color source):
-- The original "source" pointed to a hyprlang .conf (colors-hyprland.conf)
-- generated by pywal. Since Hyprland 0.55, hyprland.lua can no longer load
-- a .conf with hyprlang variables directly: only .lua files can be
-- required/loaded. Pywal also generates an equivalent template at
-- ~/.cache/wal/colors-hyprland.lua (a table with color1, color2,
-- background, ...), so that version is loaded here instead. If your pywal
-- template doesn't generate that .lua yet, you'll need to create/enable it
-- to keep the same result.
local colors = dofile("/home/javier/.cache/wal/colors-hyprland.lua")

